45},"vertical":{"unit":"track","from":89,"to":103},"depiction":"https://stacks.stanford.edu/image/iiif/xg976jt9573%2Fxg976jt9573_0001/3505,207441,460,1900/full/270/default.jpg","transcription":{"@type":"text","@id":"copies/xg976jt9573.jsonld#inscription-text","text":"141925"},"medium":"ink"}]}],"scan":"https://stacks.stanford.edu/image/iiif/xg976jt9573%2Fxg976jt9573_0001/","readFrom":{"kind":"scan"},"production":{"company":{"name":"M. Welte & Söhne","sameAs":[]},"system":{"@id":"https://w3id.org/reo/type/system/welte-t100"},"date":{"within":"1925-04-01","@annotation":{"@id":"copies/xg976jt9573.jsonld#date-annotation","belief":{"@type":"belief","@id":"copies/xg976jt9573.jsonld#date-belief","certainty":"likely","reasons":[{"@type":"meaningComprehension","comprehends":["copies/xg976jt9573.jsonld#inscription-text"],"note":"ink, upright in the lower panel, a steeply right-leaning hand; read after shearing the line upright. Six figures, evenly spaced and without separators: 1, 4, 1, 9, 2, 5. The 9 is a closed loop with a plain descender, distinct from the 2 beside it, which carries the usual base stroke. Of the possible groupings only 1 | 4 | 1925 gives a date, so 1 April 1925; 14 | 19 | 25 would need a nineteenth month. The 4 is the least certain figure. Crop 2 carries a pencilled four-figure number, 5571 or 5521, its third figure crossed like a 7; crop 3 shows the printed label, WELTE-MIGNON No. 5521, 'My Isle of Golden Dreams', Waltz, Walter Blaufuss, played by Henry Dark. Crop 4 not needed."}]}}},"perforator":{"@type":"Perforator","@id":"copies/xg976jt9573.jsonld#perforator","condition":{"conditionType":"setting","punchDiameter":{"value":1.8518,"unit":"mm","@annotation":{"@id":"copies/xg976jt9573.jsonld#punch-diameter-annotation","belief":{"@type":"belief","@id":"copies/xg976jt9573.jsonld#punch-diameter-belief","certainty":"possible","reasons":[{"@type":"measurement","note":"AVG_HOLE_WIDTH of the roll's SUPRA analysis: the parser's box at its own grey level, averaged 