,"belief":{"@type":"belief","@id":"copies/mv647hz9361.jsonld#date-belief","certainty":"possible","reasons":[{"@type":"meaningComprehension","comprehends":["copies/mv647hz9361.jsonld#inscription-text"],"note":"stamped, upright in the upper panel, the whole impression heavily over-inked. Five positions: the first is a solid blob I cannot resolve, the other four are 8, 5, 2, 5, the 5s with their top flag and bowl and the 2 with its base stroke. Five figures read as day, month, year in the way reading.md describes for 14114, so ?8.5.25: the month and year are May 1925, the day is 8, 18 or 28 and the leading figure is not legible. Only the month is entered. Crop 3 carries a pencilled 5669 and crop 4 the printed label, WELTE-MIGNON No. 5669, 'Sergeant Percy', One-step, Richard Fall, played by Sidny Black; crop 2 is blank."}]}}},"perforator":{"@type":"Perforator","@id":"copies/mv647hz9361.jsonld#perforator","condition":{"conditionType":"setting","punchDiameter":{"value":1.8061,"unit":"mm","@annotation":{"@id":"copies/mv647hz9361.jsonld#punch-diameter-annotation","belief":{"@type":"belief","@id":"copies/mv647hz9361.jsonld#punch-diameter-belief","certainty":"possible","reasons":[{"@type":"measurement","note":"AVG_HOLE_WIDTH of the roll's SUPRA analysis: the parser's box at its own grey level, averaged over every perforation it kept, so that a tear or a run of dust drags it. On the three copies measured both ways, an edge at half the contrast put the punch 0.10 to 0.15 mm wider (punch-225/README.md).","used":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pianoroll/piano-roll-analyses/main/analysis/m/mv647hz9361_analysis.txt.bz2","https://github.com/pfefferniels/welte225.org/blob/0f6bcfb85154f3d2c2928049b7518463fad1d1c9/punch-225/dates/pitch.py"]}]}}},"chainPitch":{"value":2.5025,"unit":"mm","slot":1.9116,"bridge":0.5833,"n":297,"@annotation":{"@id":"copies/mv647hz9361.jsonld#chain-pitch-annotation","belief":{"@type":"belief","@id":"copies/mv647hz9361.jsonld#chain-pitch-belief","certaint